<title>UK: B.A.T on fresh settlement hopes.</title>
<headline>B.A.T on fresh settlement hopes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in B.A.T Industries Plc rose in early trade on Friday, echoing gains in U.S. tobacco stocks on continued talk of an agreement in U.S. talks aimed at a settlement of lawsuits over smoking-related diseases.</p>
<p>B.A.T shares were up 7p at 589 by 0737 GMT in volume of just over half a million shares. In New York on Thursday, Philip Morris Cos inc rose $1-7/8 to $47-3/8 and RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp rose $1-3/8 to $35-7/8.</p>
</text>
